      "text": [
        " عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ «عَلَيْهِ جَزُورٌ كَوْمَاءُ» فَقَالَ لاَ يَقْدِرُ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ «يَنْبَغِي لِأَصْحَابِهِ أَنْ يَجْمَعُوا لَهُ وَ لاَ يُفْسِدُوا عَلَيْهِ حَجَّهُ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2589 - Abu Basir asked Imam (as) about a man who had intercourse with his wife while in the state of Ihram.\nImam (as) said: \"He must offer a large camel (jazur kawmā’).\"\nAbu Basir said: \"What if he cannot afford it?\"\nImam (as) replied: \"It is upon his companions to contribute on his behalf, and they should not invalidate his Hajj.\""
        ]
      }
